{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060040/extras/abeb10934050c977d6b1c1fd6e852f17.avif?t=1759430797\" width=1500 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Endless Corridors&quot; is a survival horror game centered on exploration and escape. Trapped within an ever-changing maze of randomly generated hallways, players must strategically manage hunger and hydration to stay alive. The environment is hostile, filled with dangerous monsters and unpredictable paranormal events. Success hinges on your ability to cautiously explore, uncover the secrets of the corridors, and locate the solitary exit point to escape the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060040/extras/346e0a0b6d9ee08d81d64fa80e44436d.avif?t=1759430797\" data-has-big width=1560 height=187 /></span>Exploration is essential to survival in the corridors. Hunt for items such as food and water to stay alive and discover the secrets of the Endless Corridors. The exit is your final goal, once you've reached the exit you can escape the corridors and survive, however there's only a single exit, so finding it will be difficult, be prepared to fight hunger and thirst as well as the environment around you to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060040/extras/88326ec1f4163fe60b90b65fb6f656ff.avif?t=1759430797\" data-has-big width=1560 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The corridors, and everything in them are procedurely generated, meaning every time you press play you get a different set of corridors to explore. You'll never know what to expect. The exit could be near. it could be far. Their could be creatures lurking around every corner. It may be silent, the only thing you can hear is your own footsteps. Millions of different possible experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060040/extras/78922b12aa4bd1fc8f8b5cfdca3c9979.avif?t=1759430797\" data-has-big width=1560 height=187 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone in these corridors. Except for yourself, there's something else. They lurk in the shadows. They hunt you down. Some can see you. Others, hear you. There is nowhere safe here.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060040?t=1759430797","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060040/c2a1e2b82266d6abb4cf80203b20841108a9658f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759430797","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060040/0d1edde6bf426d7b5d22b96724a5cc8607e6500d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759430797","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060040/0d1edde6bf426d7b5d22b96724a5cc8607e6500d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759430797","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","